<title>USA: Covenant Bank gets approval on merger.</title>
<headline>Covenant Bank gets approval on merger.</headline>
<dateline>HADDONFIELD, N.J. 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Covenant Bank said on Friday it received regulatory approval of its pending acquisition of 1st Southern State Bank, based in Avalon, N.J.</p>
<p>The bank said the deal should close by the end of the third quarter and provides for consummation through an exchange of 1st Southern stock for Covenant stock.</p>
</text>
